WEBVTT

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:03.390
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:03.390
Such a sad midnight,

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:09.330
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:09.330
overflowing with love.

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:19.900
kiiroi ringo o kajitteru

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:19.840
Gnawing at a yellow apple,

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:23.860
kimi wa hitoshirezu otona ni naru

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:23.860
you secretly become an adult.

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:27.300
tameiki iro shite mayoikomu

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:27.300
You sigh, having lost your way

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:31.070
ai o sagashite ikiteru

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:31.070
living in a search for love.

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:35.350
suki yo tabun ne dakedo

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:35.350
Maybe I love you, but—

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:38.790
akai tsuki ga miteru

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:38.790
the red moon is watching,

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:45.380
konna ni mo chikaku ni iru no ni

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:45.380
it waits nearby.

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:49.840
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:49.840
Such a sad midnight.

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:49.910
I can say love

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:53.640
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:53.640
It overflows with love.

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:53.640
will you love me?

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:57.250
tomadoi no hitomi no oku

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:57.250
Lost within your eyes,

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.200
kokyuu o tomete

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.200
I stop breathing.

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:03.760
kimi no ai o katachi ni

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:03.760
The shape of your love,

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:08.410
mayonaka no taiyou

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:08.410
is like the midnight sun.

00:01:37.190 --> 00:01:41.490
Washu-sama is simply amazing! This latest ship of hers is incredible!

00:01:41.490 --> 00:01:43.580
With this ship, we have nothing to...

00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:50.900
What's wrong?

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:53.030
Are you done with the diagnostic checks already?

00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:54.700
That's not it.

00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:57.870
I could swear I've seen that Neige girl somewhere before...

00:01:57.870 --> 00:02:00.740
I'm under the impression she's the daughter of a really important family,

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:04.340
so perhaps you've seen her at a party before?

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:05.710
Maybe...

00:02:05.710 --> 00:02:07.910
Don't you start prying into her affairs now.

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:13.420
W-what...?!

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:14.720
What's the matter?!

00:02:14.720 --> 00:02:16.690
What is it?

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:18.760
Did we pick up a distress signal?

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:19.590
No!

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:21.730
Headquarters just sent us our orders...

00:02:21.730 --> 00:02:23.000
This can't be right...

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:23.670
Let's see...

00:02:23.670 --> 00:02:27.260
It is up to the captain to decide what course to take.

00:02:27.700 --> 00:02:30.010
What's the big deal? Isn't that how it always is?

00:02:30.010 --> 00:02:33.340
You are absolutely not to attack, even in the event of a pirate encounter.

00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:36.840
T-They can't be serious...!

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:42.800
A Tiny Adversary 
Appears!

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:47.300
N-Neige-chan...

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:51.670
How come you old ladies have such scary looks on your faces?

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:52.810
I'll have you know, Neige...!

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:55.240
...Let it go! ...She's only...

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:59.320
I-I'm sorry...

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:03.350
This isn't my first time being a decoy...

00:03:03.350 --> 00:03:06.690
So I'll be all right, you don't need to worry about me...

00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:08.520
Y-you mean you've...?

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:11.690
Neige-chan...

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:15.330
B-but you're even younger than my little sister...

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:16.090
"Sister: Yoshiko"

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:18.230
You have a younger sister on Earth?

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:19.000
Y-yeah.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:21.470
She's so lucky to have you for a big brother!

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:24.170
Big Brother...

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:44.490
It's OK. If we can just stay barricaded inside this armored block...!

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:46.300
We can't hold out for very long, though.

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:47.600
The GP will send a rescue team...!

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:48.900
But it'll be a while until they get here.

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:50.330
What's the matter, Alan?

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.270
Don't be changing the subject!

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:56.570
...Alan! ...Where're you going?

00:03:56.570 --> 00:03:58.310
The pirates are gonna catch you!

00:03:58.310 --> 00:04:00.340
Stop being reckless!

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:05.440
The three of us comprise one character!

00:04:11.190 --> 00:04:14.220
I want to sleep in your room, Big Brother!

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:15.990
You'll let me sleep with you, won't you?

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:18.430
We've already prepared a room just for you, Neige-chan!

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:20.130
You're old enough that you can sleep by yourself, right?

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:24.270
But what if I have a bad dream?!

00:04:24.270 --> 00:04:26.000
I-I guess there's no talking you out of it...

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:27.740
I guess it's alright if you sleep with me.

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:29.370
Really?!

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:31.310
W-wait a minute...

00:04:31.310 --> 00:04:32.980
You're welcome to stay with me!

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:36.410
Yeah! You'll sleep much better if you snuggle up with her!

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:40.380
No! I want to be with my big brother!

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:42.090
I-I think we're stuck...

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:45.960
That hussy! Waltzin' in here and putting the moves on him like that...!

00:04:45.960 --> 00:04:50.030
Come on, Neige-chan's still a child, you know...

00:04:50.030 --> 00:04:51.890
What are you straining yourself for, Kiriko?

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:54.530
I-I'm not straining myself...!

00:04:54.530 --> 00:04:55.570
Yes you are.

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:59.260
Kiriko-san. You're easier to read than you look...

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:06.140
You can use this room as if it were your own.

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:08.310
I don't get the same room as you, Big Brother?

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:09.110
No.

00:05:09.110 --> 00:05:10.480
Only when it's bedtime...

00:05:10.480 --> 00:05:12.310
Phooey...

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:18.490
He's just laughing it up in there...

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:20.620
What do you suppose they're talking about?

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:22.760
Knock it off you two! You should be ashamed of yourselves!

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:24.630
Then why don't you go back to the bridge, Kiriko?

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:26.400
Yeah!

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:30.800
It's my responsibility to make sure that nothing bad happens to Seina-kun!

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:32.270
Sure, whatever.

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:35.740
You ladies are amateurs!

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:37.740
Let me show you how it's done!

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:40.580
This here situation calls for my special spy camera!

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:44.310
But I had no idea you ladies were into this sorta thing too!

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:46.820
I am not into this sort of thing!

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:48.990
You have some nerve, spying on other people's private lives...!

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:51.090
Kiriko!

00:05:51.090 --> 00:05:56.330
You're exactly right. As their elders, we're making sure that things

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:59.100
between Seina-kun and that little brat proceed in the proper direction.

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:04.070
A guy's first instinct is to jump all over cute girls that call him big brother!

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:09.330
It's just how they are! Watch and see! Don't miss anything good now!

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:17.950
What are you old ladies doing?

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:23.550
Who, us? We were just gettin' ready to watch you two get it on...

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:25.890
Shut up!

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:42.910
I can't believe they gave us a new ship but won't let us attack!

00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:45.640
There's nothing we can do about it, those were Seto-sama's orders!

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:46.840
I know that!

00:06:50.650 --> 00:06:52.650
Enemy ships off the stern! Distance at 80 and closing!

00:06:52.650 --> 00:06:54.750
We're in big trouble if we don't get some distance between us soon!

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:56.790
Let's go to Combat Speed 1!

00:06:56.790 --> 00:06:58.920
Roger! Increasing energy output!

00:06:58.920 --> 00:07:00.160
30...

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:01.190
35...

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:03.960
40!

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:06.330
Damn that old hag! She gave us a crappy hunk of junk!

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:07.200
What are you talking about?!

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:10.000
This is Professor Washu's very latest ship!

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:12.440
Wait, maybe it's...

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:15.510
M-my fault...?

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:17.170
Anyway, we need to get these pirates off of our tail!

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:18.810
Yeah, right! Like we have any way of doing that!

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:20.110
This is not the time to argue!

00:07:20.110 --> 00:07:23.450
Distance 60! Off our stern! They're now close enough to capture our ship!

00:07:23.450 --> 00:07:25.180
Please don't shatter!

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:31.150
Not good.

00:07:43.070 --> 00:07:44.760
Ow...

00:07:59.150 --> 00:07:59.980
Whoa...!

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:02.820
...Can we catch 'em? ...I don't think we can!

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:17.770
Amazing! This is the same type of ship as Ryo-Ohki!

00:08:17.770 --> 00:08:20.770
Ryo-Ohki? The one who rescued us the other day?

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:25.170
So this animal acts as the ship's energy generator and computer?

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:29.110
Then that means the sudden energy output just now was her energy...

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:31.850
And yet she's so tiny... incredible...

00:08:31.850 --> 00:08:35.720
Of course! Ryo-Ohki's power rivals even the Royal Trees, after all!

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:37.550
Remarkable!

00:08:39.920 --> 00:08:43.380
Stop that! You old ladies are scaring her!

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:44.990
There, there.

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:47.400
It'll be inconvenient if you don't have a name.

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:49.700
You give her one, Big Brother.

00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:50.930
M-me?

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:53.770
You are the ship's captain.

00:08:53.770 --> 00:08:56.110
I guess you have a point there...

00:08:56.110 --> 00:08:57.770
Let's see...

00:09:00.780 --> 00:09:02.880
How about Fuku, from the word KOUFUKU?

00:09:02.880 --> 00:09:05.280
Fuku-chan? That's so cute!

00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:11.090
Wouldn't the KOU from KOUFUKU be prettier?

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:12.560
Like SACHI-chan or something...

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:16.660
But KOU also shows up in the word FUKOU.

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:19.960
FUKU, on the other hand, doesn't really have any ominous connotations.

00:09:19.960 --> 00:09:21.620
...Seina-chan... ...Seina-san...

00:09:27.070 --> 00:09:29.060
Big Brother! Say ah!

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:33.340
Yummy?

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:34.710
It sure is!

00:09:39.980 --> 00:09:42.920
She's just a kid! Don't get mad!

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:45.590
Kiriko-san, you're doing it again...

00:09:45.590 --> 00:09:47.760
You have such a big back, Big Brother...

00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:49.130
D-do I really?

00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:51.890
What?! I still haven't had the chance to wash his back...!

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:53.430
She's still a kid...!

00:09:53.430 --> 00:09:55.460
How dare she do something like this as a little girl!

00:09:55.460 --> 00:09:59.700
I was much, much cuter when I was a kid!

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:01.140
When you were a kid. Right...

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:02.540
"Amane, age 9" You've grown up so much, Amane-san.

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:04.670
You've grown up so much, Amane-san.

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:06.370
What's that supposed to mean?

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:11.680
I wish things could stay exactly like this.

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:13.750
Y-yeah.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:14.680
You know what?

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:21.590
When I grow up I want to be your wife.

00:10:21.590 --> 00:10:23.590
What's wrong, Big Brother?

00:10:23.590 --> 00:10:29.230
T-that's the first time a girl's ever said that to me...

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:33.400
...Can I get a little closer to you? ...Sure.

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:34.600
Why, that little...!

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:37.570
And there's nothing we can do about it...!

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:41.280
Luckily for us, neither can Seina-sama!

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:42.410
Well, duh!

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:45.580
He sees her as a younger sister figure!

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:47.250
So once she gets back home...

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:49.270
But what if by some remote chance...!

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:03.260
Yay!

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:15.180
Is this really the inside of a spaceship?

00:11:15.180 --> 00:11:16.880
What's the matter, Big Brother?

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:18.680
Come in!

00:11:18.680 --> 00:11:20.050
Right!

00:11:25.990 --> 00:11:29.950
I hate her, I hate her, I hate her!

00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:36.900
There's no need to worry, Kiriko-san. Your chest is much larger than...

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:37.830
Ouch!

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:39.400
Kiriko! Let's do it!

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:43.970
This is our chance to show off what makes adults different than children!

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:45.310
That's right!

00:11:45.310 --> 00:11:48.540
Seina-sama will stop dead in his tracks!

00:11:48.910 --> 00:11:51.740
That girl... She isn't a child!

00:11:53.180 --> 00:11:54.080
What do you mean?

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:54.920
Yes, what do you mean?

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:56.520
Look!

00:11:56.520 --> 00:11:58.790
That insignia on the necklace she's wearing!

00:11:58.790 --> 00:12:01.260
That's the Melmas' emblem!

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:03.160
Melmas?

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:05.660
High Priestess Neige Na Melmas?!

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:08.800
Now I remember! I thought I had seen her somewhere before...

00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:10.000
She's probably just a body double,

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:13.040
but even so, she's definitely much older than she looks!

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:18.840
Who is she to call us old ladies when she's way older than we are?!

00:12:21.310 --> 00:12:24.080
I wish I could live in a castle like this!

00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:26.010
Together with you, Big Brother!

00:12:28.320 --> 00:12:30.820
Oh, Seina-sama...

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:33.460
Fancy meeting you here...

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:36.630
Um... uh... hello...

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:38.360
H-hello...

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:42.360
I wonder if you're still too young to have giant breasts like these, Neige-chan?

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:45.670
I hear drinking milk is a good way to help them grow...

00:12:45.670 --> 00:12:47.340
N-Neige-chan...?

00:12:47.340 --> 00:12:49.570
You old ladies sure are trying hard.

00:12:49.570 --> 00:12:53.810
Um, just so you know, I tried to talk them out of this...

00:12:53.810 --> 00:12:55.440
You're the old lady!

00:12:59.850 --> 00:13:02.920
...Seina-chan! ...Seina-sama!

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:04.790
...Big Brother! Are you all right?! ...What the hell...?

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:06.620
...Who took our swimsuits? ...Say something!

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:09.360
Are you feeling ill because you saw something you shouldn't have?

00:13:09.360 --> 00:13:10.880
Say something!

00:13:14.260 --> 00:13:17.930
Yahoo! I caught me a big ol' haul!

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:21.100
I'm gonna store this moment in my memory banks!

00:13:21.100 --> 00:13:24.730
Now I'll get to see them topless whenever I want...!

00:13:25.980 --> 00:13:29.280
M-my memory banks...! My sweet vision...!

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:31.780
Oh no, saltwater!

00:13:31.780 --> 00:13:34.650
Give those back now!

00:13:34.650 --> 00:13:35.780
That was funny.

00:13:35.780 --> 00:13:39.760
Funny? This is what I have to put up with everyday.

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:44.220
But this is the first time I've had this much fun.

00:13:44.660 --> 00:13:47.000
Neige-chan. Come visit again sometime.

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:49.600
Any time you want to.

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:52.930
After all, I am going to be your wife someday!

00:13:57.640 --> 00:13:58.610
And what do you think you're doing?!

00:13:58.610 --> 00:14:01.380
Big Brother! Big Brother!

00:14:01.380 --> 00:14:03.000
He is not your big brother!

00:14:06.980 --> 00:14:08.580
What are you thinking?!

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:09.790
Even though you're just a body double,

00:14:09.790 --> 00:14:12.020
the High Priestess is supposed to maintain her purity,

00:14:12.020 --> 00:14:15.190
so how can you act that way in front of other people?!

00:14:15.190 --> 00:14:18.290
Let me be frank. Keep your hands off of Seina.

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:19.800
W-what?!

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:22.030
Haven't you taken your joke a little too far, Neige-sama?!

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:23.200
What are you talking about?

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:24.190
You...!

00:14:26.940 --> 00:14:29.570
I can't have you telling any of this to him.

00:14:29.570 --> 00:14:32.370
What...? You're really...?

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:33.440
The real High Priestess...?

00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:36.580
You're not to say a word to him about this until our trip is over.

00:14:36.580 --> 00:14:40.750
You know that I can control people's collective consciousnesses.

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:45.390
Manipulating your minds would be no trouble for me at all.

00:14:45.390 --> 00:14:48.220
Isn't that forbidden?!

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:49.660
Don't look so frightened.

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:51.790
I have a legitimate reason for doing this.

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:54.000
But this is our little secret for now, okay?

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:55.700
What's the matter?

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:58.130
What did you guys suddenly run off for?

00:14:58.130 --> 00:15:01.590
I told them you and I are friends and that they were getting in the way!

00:15:02.570 --> 00:15:05.610
Why, you...!

00:15:05.610 --> 00:15:07.340
Stay here, Neige-chan!

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:08.670
Let's go, Fuku!

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:16.250
Alright! Treasure!

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:19.690
Get 'em and steal 'em!

00:15:21.990 --> 00:15:24.530
We're sustaining damage! Strengthening the shields!

00:15:24.530 --> 00:15:26.080
Shake them off!

00:15:27.300 --> 00:15:30.070
Our energy output won't go up!

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:32.300
Keep firin'! More!

00:15:44.310 --> 00:15:46.280
They got Pirate B!

00:15:46.280 --> 00:15:48.050
Stay sharp!

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:51.290
One of the leading enemy ships has taken damage and been destroyed!

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:54.720
Come on, we're not supposed to attack!

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:56.730
Fuku-chan!

00:15:56.730 --> 00:16:00.790
We've been ordered not to attack anyone during this mission.

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:06.240
Those bastards are gonna pay fer blowin' up Pirate B!

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:07.240
Don't let 'em get away!

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:10.070
Aye, aye, boss! They're as good as dead!

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:18.510
Why? Why didn't you escape with the rest of the crew?

00:16:18.510 --> 00:16:20.950
As captain of this ship, I should be the only one taken prisoner...!

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:22.280
What are you saying?

00:16:22.280 --> 00:16:25.020
I can't abandon the ship.

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:27.860
And... I'm pregnant...

00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:30.360
You don't mean... my child...?

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:31.390
Captain...

00:16:31.390 --> 00:16:32.590
Naoko-kun...

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:34.660
Come on! We don't need none of this lovey dovey crap!

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:36.730
Get movin'!

00:16:36.730 --> 00:16:38.630
Hold on!

00:16:38.630 --> 00:16:39.800
Alan...

00:16:39.800 --> 00:16:41.370
Let them go.

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:43.640
If it's prisoners you want, we should be more than enough!

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:44.940
P-prisoners?

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:45.810
Us?

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:46.980
Y-you...!

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:48.740
Alan... You...

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:51.050
Don't run out on your friends.

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:53.380
That's what my last captain taught me.

00:16:53.380 --> 00:16:54.950
A- Alan...

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:59.250
...Alan... You've... ...... impressed Naoko-san...

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:01.960
...but now what's going to happen to us?!

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:04.190
Find out next episode!

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:08.660
Uh, Miss...

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:10.930
I'm still alive, you know...

00:17:10.930 --> 00:17:14.640
Sorry, but if any of your pictures of me were to get out...

00:17:14.640 --> 00:17:17.110
I... didn't see anything...

00:17:17.110 --> 00:17:19.310
A-and my memory banks are on the fritz...

00:17:19.310 --> 00:17:21.510
Maybe...

00:17:21.510 --> 00:17:23.980
Fuku-chan!

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:27.980
Oh no! I'm not supposed to get sand in there!

00:17:27.980 --> 00:17:31.090
Keep it up! We almost got 'em!

00:17:31.090 --> 00:17:32.890
If this keeps up we don't need to worry about getting caught,

00:17:32.890 --> 00:17:34.190
we're going to get killed instead!

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:37.030
We need more energy output...!

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:38.390
It's no good...!

00:17:38.390 --> 00:17:40.160
It just won't increase!

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:41.430
T-that can't be...!

00:17:41.430 --> 00:17:42.970
Then this ship's done for...!

00:17:42.970 --> 00:17:45.470
Don't worry, Big Brother.

00:17:45.470 --> 00:17:47.770
Neige-chan! It's dangerous here!

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:55.780
Fuku-chan...

00:17:55.780 --> 00:17:58.410
It's all right, Fuku-chan. Calm down.

00:18:00.020 --> 00:18:02.080
Everything's going to be OK.

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:04.920
Don't be scared.

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:06.890
Show us your power.

00:18:11.090 --> 00:18:13.960
Keep blastin' away!

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:18.600
W-what's this...?

00:18:21.900 --> 00:18:23.640
Energy output stabilized!

00:18:23.640 --> 00:18:25.570
Engine output has suddenly increased!

00:18:25.570 --> 00:18:27.370
Alright! We can do it!

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:33.210
What the hell...?!

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:48.660
Uh, don't follow 'em.

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:50.660
Right.

00:19:00.840 --> 00:19:03.080
Well done.

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:04.780
So there you are, you old bat!

00:19:04.780 --> 00:19:08.440
How dare you set us up like that!

00:19:09.320 --> 00:19:12.690
Neige-sama's time as High Priestess is almost over.

00:19:12.690 --> 00:19:14.760
When her time is up she must appoint the next High Priestess.

00:19:14.760 --> 00:19:17.560
If something were to happen to her before then,

00:19:17.560 --> 00:19:21.720
the next one would be chosen by majority vote in the High Council.

00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:24.500
A High Priestess possesses ultimate political authority;

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:29.270
manipulating one would be the same as gaining control of her territory.

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:34.280
Many would like to acquire this power by abducting Neige-sama.

00:19:34.280 --> 00:19:36.580
So you made us act as lures for them?!

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:38.910
You did a wonderful job!

00:19:38.910 --> 00:19:44.940
In exchange, Seto-sama asked me to ascertain Big Brother's abilities.

00:19:45.420 --> 00:19:49.930
I wished to investigate the nature of Seina-dono's ability to attract pirates,

00:19:49.930 --> 00:19:53.450
and how these abilities of his differ from her own.

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:58.200
And if those powers were exactly the same as those of a High Priestess...?

00:19:58.200 --> 00:20:00.770
Seina-chan would be put under strict observation,

00:20:00.770 --> 00:20:04.670
and the big shots would put all sorts of restrictions and limitations on him.

00:20:05.310 --> 00:20:07.610
What?! How can you treat people like that?!

00:20:07.610 --> 00:20:09.310
Don't worry.

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:13.080
Big Brother's powers are different than mine.

00:20:18.850 --> 00:20:21.320
Thank you for everything you've done for me.

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:24.590
Take care, Neige-chan.

00:20:24.590 --> 00:20:27.590
You too, Big Brother.

00:20:31.570 --> 00:20:32.970
Oh, yes...

00:20:32.970 --> 00:20:35.400
Don't forget our promise, Big Brother.

00:20:36.510 --> 00:20:40.740
When I grow up, you'll let me be your wife. Remember?

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:43.180
Oh... yeah...

00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:46.450
As long as we stay away from Melmas there's nothing to worry about.

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:50.290
Once a High Priestess returns to secular life she's not allowed to leave the planet.

00:20:50.290 --> 00:20:51.720
Oh, really?

00:20:51.720 --> 00:20:54.420
I'm sure it'll be really lonely, but what are you gonna do?

00:20:54.420 --> 00:20:57.060
Oh, then it'll be goodbye to Neige-chan forever...

00:20:57.060 --> 00:20:59.130
Not quite.

00:20:59.130 --> 00:21:03.930
Neige-sama's powers far surpass those of all previous High Priestesses.

00:21:03.930 --> 00:21:06.300
As she has been the High Priestess and in center of the political arena

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:11.300
for these past several millennia, she undoubtedly knows a great many things.

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:16.950
A court lady of the Melmas High Council is in extreme danger

00:21:16.950 --> 00:21:19.980
the very moment she returns to secular life.

00:21:19.980 --> 00:21:23.320
Assassination, imprisonment, exile...

00:21:23.320 --> 00:21:26.560
Are you saying that some of those people we lured out were assassins?!

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:29.320
As we've destroyed the spirit of would-be assassins and captors,

00:21:29.320 --> 00:21:33.760
all that's left are those who might try to have her banished...

00:21:33.760 --> 00:21:37.070
She was absolutely delighted when I suggested she enter the Academy.

00:21:37.070 --> 00:21:38.300
Then...

00:21:38.300 --> 00:21:39.330
You don't mean...

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:40.800
No...

00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:42.630
I shall return!

00:21:47.640 --> 00:21:48.970
W-what's the matter?

00:21:53.320 --> 00:21:55.020
W-what's wrong?

00:21:55.020 --> 00:21:58.390
Neige-chan, Kiriko-san, Amane-san, and Ryoko-san...

00:21:58.390 --> 00:22:00.390
How come Neige-chan is smiling...?

00:22:00.390 --> 00:22:03.990
And how come Kiriko-san and the others are so sad?

00:22:03.990 --> 00:22:09.230
Excuse me, but could someone explain what's going on in easier terms?!

00:22:16.240 --> 00:22:27.020
You're the worst, most hopeless, 
most unlucky boy in all of space...

00:22:32.260 --> 00:22:34.890
Even against your will... 
(You fail.)

00:22:34.890 --> 00:22:36.700
Even when you're gentle... 
(You're extremely clumsy.)

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:41.200
With too much fighting spirit, 
in vain, it's all coming to nothing...

00:22:41.200 --> 00:22:44.190
You're gonna fail.

00:22:45.370 --> 00:22:48.040
Carefully...
(So irritating!)

00:22:48.040 --> 00:22:50.040
Or with violence...
(Ow! Quit it!)

00:22:50.040 --> 00:23:01.110
You're the worst and most hopeless...
you're a lost cause.

00:23:05.560 --> 00:23:10.830
You're the worst and the most hopeless...


00:23:10.830 --> 00:23:15.170
You're an unlucky boy...

00:23:15.170 --> 00:23:20.510
But, any way, I'm with you.

00:23:20.510 --> 00:23:25.670
So, more and more,
keep on doing what you do!

00:23:31.280 --> 00:23:34.550
Fuku- The Kamidake's computer and energy generator.

00:23:34.550 --> 00:23:38.320
Maybe it's because she was just born, but she's hopelessly afraid of fighting.

00:23:38.320 --> 00:23:41.890
On a completely unrelated note, I wonder if Fuku's a mammal?

00:23:41.890 --> 00:23:43.890
Next time on Tenchi Muyo GXP!

00:23:43.890 --> 00:23:45.120
Fuku-chan Runs Away
